 "origin": "issue-1813",
 "quests": {
  "1534-progress": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Brine",
   "npc": "5899",
   "questID": 1534,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Do you have the water yet, $N? Tales say the ruins were protected by large creatures of nature that do not care for visitors, but those could be myths to scare off the enemies of the night elves.\n\nRegardless, be careful.",
   "time": 1791420878,
   "title": "Call of Water",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "1535-progress": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Brine",
   "npc": "5899",
   "questID": 1535,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I am just about prepared to send you on your other tasks. Have you filled the skin yet?\n\nI know how protective the quilboar can be. Even such a small water source is a vast hoard of wealth to them. They have great feasts when even the slightest rain comes to the Barrens. Water is sacred to their kind because it is so scarce. Do you understand?",
   "time": 1791348129,
   "title": "Call of Water",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "1536-progress": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Brine",
   "npc": "5899",
   "questID": 1536,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The well remaining pure within the town reminds me of stories told to me when I was younger, $N. Even in times of great pain and sorrow one can find a sliver of hope, a small symbol to rally around. The orc people see Thrall this way. He survived against great odds and rose up to lead our people through his strength and example.\n\nI'm not sure any orc has suffered as much as he has, but at the same time, I'm not sure any orc is as strong as he is either.",
   "time": 1791353435,
   "title": "Call of Water",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "220-progress": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Islen Waterseer",
   "npc": "5901",
   "questID": 220,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Hello again, $N. You're looking well.\n\nWhat brings you back to me so soon?",
   "time": 1791421307,
   "title": "Call of Water",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "502-progress": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1424,
   "name": "Stanley",
   "npc": "2274",
   "questID": 502,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Woof?",
   "time": 1791424927,
   "title": "Elixir of Pain",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Hillsbrad Foothills"
  },
  "63-progress": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": true,
   "mapID": 1421,
   "name": "Unknown",
   "npc": "-113791",
   "questID": 63,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The brazier still reflects the ambient light from the area, and the flame shifts slightly as you move closer.\n\nThe corruption along the hills seems to have kept its distance, and besides the missing components, the brazier looks prepared for the ritual to summon a cleansed manifestation of water.",
   "time": 1791421994,
   "title": "Call of Water",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Silverpine Forest"
  },
  "6543-progress": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Kadrak",
   "npc": "8582",
   "questID": 6543,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Hurry, $N. They must receive their reports; it is urgent.",
   "time": 1791420017,
   "title": "The Warsong Reports",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "96-progress": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Shaman",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Islen Waterseer",
   "npc": "5901",
   "questID": 96,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You've returned. Splendid!\n\nHow went your journey to Silverpine? Did it take you long?\n\nIt is hard for me to tell if you were successful there because so much of the land has become corrupt. Its stench overwhelms any good that you might have done. But small successes are sometimes as important as large ones. Purifying the water there was instrumental for you, and for all shamans.",
   "time": 1791423695,
   "title": "Call of Water",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "98576-progress": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "progress",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1411,
   "name": "Mai'ah",
   "npc": "5884",
   "questID": 98576,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Ya come to Mai'ah ready to learn. Dat be good. Ya got da power to touch da strands of da cosmos, but ya also got da wisdom to know dat you need guidance. I can teach ya da first steps to wield dat power.",
   "time": 1791427408,
   "title": "Glyphic Parchment",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Durotar"
  }
